 "Pīrī Pāshā, Ramazanoğlu", "death_ce": 1567, "death_h": 974, "birth_ce": 1510, "birth_h": 916, "gender": "M", "field": "administration", "sub_fields": ["politics", "law"], "era": "Ottoman", "region": "Anatolia", "ethnicity": "Turkish", "state": "Ottoman Empire", "bio": "Ramazanoğulları beyi ve Osmanlı devlet adamı.", "importance": "medium", "sources": ["dia"], "source_count": 1, "dia_slug": "piri-pasa-ramazanoglu", "dia_importance": 31.14, "relations_count": 0, "works_count": 6, "tabakat_books": 0, "field_normalized": "politics", "era_normalized": "Ottoman"}, "dia:piri-reis": {"id": "dia:piri-reis", "name_tr": "PÎRÎ REİS", "name_en": "Pīrī Reis", "death_ce": 1553, "death_h": 960, "gender": "M", "field": "geography", "sub_fields": ["geography", "mathematics", "administration"], "era": "Ottoman", "region": "Anatolia", "ethnicity": "Turkish", "state": "Ottoman Empire", "bio": "Kitâb-ı Bahriyyemüellifi, ünlü Osmanlı haritacı ve denizcisi.", "notable_work": "Kitāb-ı Baḥriyye", "importance": "high", "sources": ["atlas", "dia"], "source_count": 2, "dia_slug": "piri-reis", "dia_importance": 36.17, "relations_count": 3, "works_count": 6, "tabakat_books": 0, "silsile_chain_tr": "Portekiz-İspanyol keşif haritaları → Pîrî Reis → Osmanlı kartografya → Kâtip Çelebi → İbrahim Müteferrika → Modern Türk coğrafyacıları", "silsile_chain_en": "Portuguese-Spanish exploration maps → Pīrī Reʾīs → Ottoman cartography → Kātip Çelebi → European geographical knowledge transmission → Islamic scientific tradition", "silsile_chain_ar": "خرائط الاستكشاف البرتغالية الاسبانية ← بيري رئيس ← الخرائط العثمانية ← كاتب چلبي ← حاجي خليفة ← الجغرافيون العثمانيون المتأخرون", "narrative_tr": "Pîrî Reis, Osmanlı denizciliğinin en önemli haritacısıdır. 1513 dünya haritası Amerika kıtasının doğu kıyılarını gösteren en eski haritalardan biri olarak kartografya tarihinde benzersiz yere sahiptir. Kolomb'un kayıp haritalarını kaynak olarak kullandığını iddia etti. Kitâb-ı Bahriyye Akdeniz'in detaylı kıyı haritalarını derler.", "narrative_en": "Piri Reis was the most important cartographer of Ottoman maritime history. His 1513 world map is one of the earliest showing America's eastern coastline. He claimed to have used Columbus's lost maps as sources. His Kitab-i Bahriye compiles detailed Mediterranean coastal maps.", "narrative_ar": "بيري رئيس من اعظم خرائطيي البحرية العثمانية. خريطته العالمية سنة 1513 تعد من اقدم الخرائط التي تظهر الشواطئ الشرقية لقارة امريكا وتحتل مكانة فريدة في تاريخ رسم الخرائط. زعم انه استعمل خرائط كولومبوس المفقودة مصدرا لعمله. كتاب البحرية يجمع خرائط مفصلة لشواطئ البحر المتوسطومعلومات ملاحية دقيقة للبحارة العثمانيين. خدم في الأسطول العثماني تحت قيادة خير الدين بربروسا وشارك في العديد من المعارك البحرية المهمة. أعماله الجغرافية لا تزال تُدرس حتى اليوم لدقتها العلمية ومساهمتها في فهم جغرافية العالم في القرن السادس عشر.", "discipline": "Geography", "discipline_tr": "Coğrafya", "birthplace_geo": {"lat": 40.41, "lon": 26.67, "city_tr": "Gelibolu", "city_en": "Gallipoli"}, "education_cities": [{"lat": 41.01, "lon": 28.98, "city_tr": "İstanbul", "city_en": "Istanbul"}, {"lat": 30.04, "lon": 31.24, "city_tr": "Kahire", "city_en": "Cairo"}], "patron_dynasty_id": 130, "patron_info_tr": "Osmanlı donanmasında kaptan olarak görev yaptı; haritalarını sultanların dikkatine sundu.", "atlas_id": 46, "field_normalized": "geography", "era_normalized": "Ottoman", "birth_ce": 1465}, "dia:pirizade-ibrahim": {"id": "dia:pirizade-ibrahim", "name_ar": "پيريزاده إبراهيم", "name_tr": "PÎRÎZÂDE İBRÂHİM", "name_en": "Pīrīzāde Ibrāhīm", "death_ce": 1688, "death_h": 1099, "gender": "M", "field": "fiqh", "sub_fields": ["law", "administration"], "madhab": "Hanefî", "era": "Ottoman", "region": "Hejaz", "state": "Ottoman", "bio": "Hanefî fakihi ve Mekke müftüsü.", "death_place": "1099", "importance": "medium", "sources": ["dia"], "source_count": 1, "dia_slug": "pirizade-ibrahim", "dia_importance": 61.18, "relations_count": 11, "works_count": 41, "tabakat_books": 0, "field_normalized":